part e2_gifts
  tally 2
  note "E2-02: gifts and inheritances across the family, 2021 to 2026-09-30. Halina's gifts to Ania are A's (a.acq, a.gift_tax; A/gift.tally); Zbigniew's estate, the shares, the day its tax arose, the report deadline and each heir's tax are D's (d.share, d.igt_tax, d.igt_arises, d.report_by; D/estate.tally). Marta's gifts to Jan (2024-07-01 and the release of 2026-09-17) and Irena's gifts to Staś are C's (C's loan.tally and stas.tally), asked in the C-side run (../cside, W-E2-4). E2 adds only what no household states: that Halina gave from her own property, so nothing she gave Ania was part of Zbigniew's estate."
  note "Whether Piotr, Anna, Marta and Jakub reported their inheritance no paper says (story.md 2025-05-05): the tax of each turns on it, so it is asked under each case: reported by d.report_by (a pin of D's rows reported_on, L §5.18), and not reported (the scenario scenarios/e2_not_reported.tally)."

index e2_gift = [cash2021, units2023]
  note "Halina's gifts to Ania, by A's keys of acq: the 15 000.00 DUK in cash of 2021-04-30 (A-D19) and the 200 BRZ-GLB-A units of 2023-09-12 (A-D18)"

input e2_gift_own[g in e2_gift]: bool question "Did Halina give this from her own property, outside the community with Zbigniew (CIV-1 .3)?"

def e2_gifts_in_estate: bool
  note "whether any of Halina's gifts to Ania came out of what became Zbigniew's estate: the estate is his own property and his half of the community (CIV-2 .2, CIV-3 .3), so a gift of Halina's own property (CIV-1 .3) is no part of it"
  rule base = any(not e2_gift_own[g] for g in e2_gift)

version e2_gift_cash
  cite e2_story
  governs always
  known 2021-04-30
  e2_gift_own[cash2021] = true "story.md 2021-04-30 (A-D19): from the money she inherited from her mother in 2018 (her own); CIV-1 .3: what a spouse acquires by inheritance is her own"

version e2_gift_units
  cite e2_story
  governs always
  known 2023-09-12
  e2_gift_own[units2023] = true "story.md 2023-09-12 (A-D18): bought with Halina's own money; CIV-1 .3: what is acquired in exchange for separate assets is separate"
